   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Full-Size Classic Keyboard: Standard full-size wired keyboard in black with durable construction. Dimensions: 17.95 × 6.65 × 1.34 inches; Weight: 1.79 lb. Plug-and-play USB connection—no drivers or software required for quick and easy setup. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Old-School Retro Design with Curved Rows: Stepped, curved key rows promote a natural typing posture and help reduce fatigue during long sessions. Made of high-quality ABS with membrane switches and 4.2 mm key travel. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Ergonomic Curved Keycaps: Keycaps feature a curved design with flatter tops and back edges to better match fingertip contours, delivering enhanced comfort and control while typing. Available in black, beige, and white. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Multiple Layout \u0026 Laser Printing Options: Comes standard with a US layout. Additional layouts available with minimum order quantity (20 pcs), including German, French, Italian, Spanish, UK, Japanese, Korean, Nordic, Hebrew, Arabic, and more. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Long Travel Distance \u0026 Tactile Feedback: Responsive keys with extended travel provide a satisfying tactile feel and audible feedback similar to brown mechanical switches. Designed for durability with a key lifespan of up to 20 million keystrokes. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Extra-Long 6 ft Wired Connection: USB-A cable allows flexible placement and easy routing above or below the desk. Cable exit supports left or right routing to accommodate different workstation layouts. "
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "Style": 112,
    "Text": "* Wide Windows Compatibility \u0026 Warranty: Compatible with Windows 7, 8, 10, and 11. Package includes 1 keyboard and 1 user manual. Backed by a 12-month limited warranty via the Perixx website "
   }
  ],
